	measure 'Last Sales Date' = ```
			
			VAR LatestDate =
			    MAXX ( ALL ( 'fact_sales'[Date] ), 'fact_sales'[Date] )
			VAR LatestMonthEnd =
			    EOMONTH ( LatestDate, -1 )   -- end of the previous full month
			RETURN
			LatestMonthEnd
			
			```
		formatString: General Date
