	measure BusyDaySales = ```
			
			VAR SelectedMonth = SELECTEDVALUE('Calendar'[Month Number])
			VAR SelectedYear  = SELECTEDVALUE('Calendar'[Year])
			RETURN
			IF (
			    MONTH ( MAX ( 'Calendar'[Date] ) ) = SelectedMonth &&
			    YEAR ( MAX ( 'Calendar'[Date] ) ) = SelectedYear,
			    SUM ( fact_sales[sales] ),   -- replace with your sales measure
			    BLANK()
			)
			
			```
		lineageTag: 7a53ddab-7654-4439-84ba-8be9852ad996

